<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bioc="http://bpmn.io/schema/bpmn/biocolor/1.0" xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_fluxbank-history-consumer-detail" targetNamespace="https://fluxbank.local/architecture" exporter="FluxBank architecture documentation" exporterVersion="2">
  <bpmn:process id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_broker" name="Kafka | transfer-events.v1" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:sendTask id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_sendTask1" name="Deliver TRANSFER_COMPLETED&#10;Group: fluxbank.transaction-history.v1" />
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmn:process id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_consumer" name="FluxBank | Transaction History consumer" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:laneSet id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_consumer_lanes">
      <bpmn:lane id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_consumer_entry" name="Listener">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_serviceTask2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_consumer_hist" name="History">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_subProcess4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_consumer_offset" name="Offset / failure">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_serviceTask18</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_serviceTask21</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_serviceTask23</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_serviceTask2" name="01 | Deserialize and invoke listener&#10;TransferEventsKafkaListener.handle()&#10;→ processor.process(event)">
      <bpmn:documentation>ErrorHandlingDeserializer → JsonDeserializer. Malformed JSON bypasses business listener and goes to recovery/DLT page. Legacy snapshot is rejected by processor before marker INSERT.
Sources: TransferEventsKafkaListener.handle() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transaction/infrastructure/kafka/TransferEventsKafkaListener.java:20</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow5</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_subProcess4" name="TX-HISTORY | TransactionHistoryEventProcessor.process() [REQUIRED]">
      <bpmn:documentation>Spring proxy starts this database transaction on entry. Successful return/flush commits all enclosed writes. RuntimeException or commit failure rolls back the enclosed writes. JPA SQL may be issued at flush; the diagram shows Java execution order. REQUIRED joins a caller transaction; the normal HTTP orchestration has no outer transaction.
Sources: TransactionHistoryEventProcessor.process() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transaction/application/TransactionHistoryEventProcessor.java:20</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow5</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_serviceTask6" name="02 | Validate + INSERT marker&#10;ProcessedEventRepository&#10;.insertIfAbsent()">
        <bpmn:documentation>Validate complete TransferCompletedEvent snapshot. INSERT INTO fluxbank.processed_event(event_id,event_type) VALUES(...) ON CONFLICT(event_id) DO NOTHING. processed_at default CURRENT_TIMESTAMP.
Sources: TransactionHistoryEventProcessor.process() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transaction/application/TransactionHistoryEventProcessor.java:20; ProcessedEventRepository.insertIfAbsent() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/processed/repository/ProcessedEventRepository.java:18</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow8</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_exclusiveGateway7" name="Inserted marker?">
        <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
        <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow8" sourceRef="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_serviceTask6" targetRef="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_exclusiveGateway7" />
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_serviceTask9" name="03 | Load completed Transfer / accounts&#10;TransactionHistoryService&#10;.createForSnapshot()">
        <bpmn:documentation>REQUIRED joins TX-HISTORY. TransferRepository.findByPublicId() must find COMPLETED. Accounts loaded by snapshot UUID. Amount/currency/type come from snapshot, not mutable Transfer metadata.
Sources: TransactionHistoryService.createForSnapshot() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transaction/application/TransactionHistoryService.java:55; TransactionHistoryService.completedTransfer() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transaction/application/TransactionHistoryService.java:68; AccountRepository.findByPublicId() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/account/repository/AccountRepository.java:32</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow10" sourceRef="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_exclusiveGateway7" targetRef="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_serviceTask9" name="1: new event" />
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_serviceTask11" name="04 | Check expected movements&#10;TransactionHistoryService&#10;.createMovements()">
        <bpmn:documentation>INTERNAL 0/0→insert pair, 1/1→no-op, partial 1/0 or 0/1→TransactionHistoryInconsistentException/rollback. EXTERNAL existing debit→no-op.
Sources: TransactionHistoryService.createMovements() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transaction/application/TransactionHistoryService.java:78; TransactionRepository.existsByTransferAndAccountAndTypeAndDirection() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transaction/repository/TransactionRepository.java:12</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow12" sourceRef="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_serviceTask9" targetRef="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_serviceTask11" />
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_serviceTask13" name="05 | INSERT missing History only&#10;TransactionRepository.saveAll() / save()&#10;INTERNAL: A DEBIT + B CREDIT&#10;EXTERNAL: A DEBIT">
        <bpmn:documentation>Each row has a UUID + unique TXN-yyyyMMdd-sequence reference. amount=+100 EUR; direction carries debit/credit meaning. Unique(transfer_id,account_id,type,direction). No balance UPDATE.
Sources: TransactionHistoryService.createMovement() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transaction/application/TransactionHistoryService.java:112; TransactionReferenceGenerator.nextReference() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transaction/application/TransactionReferenceGenerator.java:18; Transaction.createTransferMovement() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transaction/domain/Transaction.java:59</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow14" sourceRef="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_serviceTask11" targetRef="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_serviceTask13" />
      <bpmn:endEvent id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_endEvent15" name="COMMIT marker + required History">
        <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow16" sourceRef="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_serviceTask13" targetRef="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_endEvent15" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow17" sourceRef="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_exclusiveGateway7" targetRef="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_endEvent15" name="0: duplicate → no-op" />
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow5" sourceRef="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_serviceTask2" targetRef="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_subProcess4" />
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_serviceTask18" name="06 | Return; commit Kafka offset&#10;Spring Kafka container&#10;RECORD; auto-commit=false">
      <bpmn:documentation>PostgreSQL COMMIT precedes listener return; Kafka offset commit is a separate operation. Duplicate no-op is also a successful delivery.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow19" sourceRef="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_subProcess4" targetRef="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_serviceTask18" />
    <bpmn:boundaryEvent id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_boundaryEvent20" name="Rollback" attachedToRef="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_subProcess4" cancelActivity="true">
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:errorEventDefinition id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_boundaryEvent20_error" />
    </bpmn:boundaryEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_serviceTask21" name="ROLLBACK marker + all History&#10;No financial balance rollback&#10;Retry classification / DLT: page 07">
      <bpmn:documentation>Finance already committed. Failed credit insert or missing/partial state rolls back marker as well. Source Kafka offset not advanced for unresolved failure.
Sources: TransferEventsConsumerConfiguration.transferEventsErrorHandler() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transaction/infrastructure/kafka/TransferEventsConsumerConfiguration.java:43</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow22" sourceRef="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_boundaryEvent20" targetRef="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_serviceTask21" />
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_serviceTask23" name="DB committed but offset failed?&#10;Same event can be delivered again&#10;Marker conflict → no-op">
      <bpmn:documentation>Concurrent same eventId waits on PostgreSQL PK conflict: first commit→0/no-op; first rollback→waiter can insert and process. No exactly-once Kafka claim.
Sources: ProcessedEventRepository.insertIfAbsent() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/processed/repository/ProcessedEventRepository.java:18</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Flow24" sourceRef="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_serviceTask18" targetRef="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_serviceTask23" name="Crash / commit failure" />
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collaboration_fluxbank-history-consumer-detail">
    <bpmn:documentation>06 | Kafka → atomic History → offset
Source: current working tree, 2026-11-08. Documentation only; isExecutable=false. Solid arrows = local execution order. Dashed arrows = HTTP/Kafka messages across pools. Green expanded subprocess = Spring database transaction, not BPMN compensation semantics. Red = failure; amber = retry/recovery. DB visibility is by commit and SELECT, not an in-memory message. Open README.md for the source index and linked pages.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:participant id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_broker_pool" name="Kafka | transfer-events.v1" processRef="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_broker" />
    <bpmn:participant id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_consumer_pool" name="FluxBank | Transaction History consumer" processRef="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_consumer" />
    <bpmn:messageFlow id="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_Message3" sourceRef="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_sendTask1" targetRef="fluxbank-history-consumer-detail_serviceTask2" name="Kafka delivery" />
  </bpmn:collaboration>
